The X3 UC8279 driver and LUTs, the X3 half-refresh LUTs in Display.cpp,
the X4 Pro UC8179 and UC8279 display paths, and the Sticky SSD1677
configuration and SSD2677 driver and LUTs are selective ports from FreeInk.

The Murphy M4 SSD1677 configuration and power sequences are selective ports
from the CrossMux FreeInk SDK. This target uses the generic SSD1677 LUT.
Source: https://github.com/0x1abin/freeink-sdk/tree/9aa7e95e02c6374a23a562c883eb302552ff24f1

